        "description": "Reviews of one Tesco product, newest first: rating, title, text, author nickname, date, verified-buyer, syndicated (with the source) and promotional / sampled flags, and photos; plus the overall rating, review count and rating distribution. Pass `next_page` back as `page`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/tesco-reviews",
